# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers (compose/localstack/ready.d is
# mounted into LocalStack). A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes
# them with CRLF, the shebang becomes "/bin/sh\r", and the script never runs:
# LocalStack logs "No such file or directory" and the receipts bucket is never
# created, so every browser upload fails straight at the bucket.
*.sh text eol=lf
